      <p class="muted" style="font-size:14px;margin-top:30px">
        Related privacy tools: <a href="/blur-face/" style="color:var(--accent-text);font-weight:600">Blur a face</a> · <a href="/redact-image/" style="color:var(--accent-text);font-weight:600">Redact an image</a> · <a href="/pixelate-image/" style="color:var(--accent-text);font-weight:600">Pixelate an image</a> · <a href="/blur-license-plate/" style="color:var(--accent-text);font-weight:600">Blur a license plate</a>
